WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
As long as I can solve it for you

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:05,170
I'll solve it for you. Thank you.

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,570
I have to go home and rest first, Brother Xiao

4
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:09,370
What are you discussing with Mr. Zhu?

5
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:11,170
I see you two are having a very heated discussion.

6
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,770
I just asked for advice

7
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:14,370
Mr. Zhu’s story about building a greenhouse

8
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,330
I want to give us there

9
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:17,330
Also build a greenhouse

10
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:18,730
Maybe later

11
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:21,730
It can also make everyone's life a little better, Brother Xiao

12
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:22,930
You are really in serious trouble

13
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:25,130
Wherever I go, I always think of my own home and admire it

14
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:26,590
No way

15
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,390
Only my own Shazhou City is left in the entire Western Region

16
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:29,790
Before falling into the hands of the army living in the building

17
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,190
After three years of fighting, I couldn’t get better than the Nine Palaces.

18
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,990
The army in the building is about to withdraw suddenly.

19
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:34,990
There must be something going on inside him

20
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:36,390
Although I don’t know now

21
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:37,790
The reason for their withdrawal

22
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:39,790
But no matter what happens to them

23
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,390
As long as things are settled

24
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:43,390
They will definitely make a comeback

25
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:46,750
We must get up during this period, Brother Xiao

26
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,150
Let’s go back and rest too

27
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,150
I still have to go to the bar to keep things going.

28
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:59,300
You are working too hard and there is nothing you can do about it, Mr. Lu.

29
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:00,900
Sorry to disturb your rest
